                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-xl-3 col-lg-3 col-md-6 mb-30">
                                <div class="al-price-item" style="height: 280px;">
                                    <div class="al-price-icon al-price-icon-connect"></div>
                                    <div class="al-price-head mb-40 pt-20">
                                        <h6 class="main-color">Step 3</h6>
                                        <h6>Connect your Trading Account with us</h6>
                                        <p>Add your trading account number in the Artisgain client area and wait for our approval.</p>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-xl-3 col-lg-3 col-md-6 mb-10">
                                <div class="al-price-item" style="height: 280px;">
                                    <div class="al-price-icon al-price-icon-cash-back"></div>
                                    <div class="al-price-head mb-40 pt-20">
                                        <h6 class="main-color">Step 4</h6>
                                        <h6>Start trading and earn cashback</h6>
                                        <p>Enjoy trading and receive a percentage of your fees back.</p>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
